# OpenClaw agent container configuration — copy to .env if you need extra
# environment variables.
#
# NOTE: OpenClaw is configured via ./data/openclaw.json, not env vars:
#   - model provider + API key:  models.providers.<name>
#   - gateway bind/port/auth:    gateway.* (auth.token is the bearer token
#     the benchmark runner sends — set the same value in the root .env as
#     BENCH_OPENCLAW_API_KEY)
#   - OpenAI-compatible endpoint: gateway.http.endpoints.chatCompletions.enabled
#
# See docker/openclaw/openclaw.json.example for a working template.
